  great_zimbabwe: "Zimbabwe spearmen guarded the great cattle herds and the stone enclosures of the Shona kingdom, the dependable infantry of a wealthy plateau state. They protected the source of the kingdom's prosperity.",
  kanem_bornu: "The Kanembu were the spear-armed royal guard of Kanem-Bornu, the steady infantry that defended the Lake Chad empire and its caravan trade. They served at the heart of one of Africa's longest-lived states.",
