  maya_holkan: "Hornet Bomb is attested Maya warfare and remembered in the Popol Vuh: sealed gourds of live wasps hurled into attacking ranks, bursting into a swarm no discipline could stand inside — while Skirmish and Hide are the forest javelin war around it.",
  // Egypt & Africa
  kush_nubia_nubian_archer: "Aimed Shot is Herodotus' testimony made mechanics: Nubia was Ta-Seti, the Land of the Bow, and its archers were famed as marksmen who picked their target — the shot lands where armor isn't, and leaves the survivor maimed.",
  carthage_war_elephant: "Trample and Terrorize are Hannibal's beasts as Polybius describes them: elephants broke armies less by crushing than by dread — horses bolted and raw troops broke at the trumpeting alone.",
