  aragon_almogaver: "Desperta Ferro! — 'Awaken iron!' — is the almogàvers' documented war-cry: they struck sparks from their blades on stone before battle, and chroniclers record veteran troops breaking at the sound. The Catalan Company carried it to Athens.",
